Package: phylograftR
Title: Graft Missing Taxa On Time-Calibrated Phylogenies
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Maël", "Doré", , "mael.dore@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3242-9242"))
Description: Graft missing taxa on time-calibrated phylogenies combining
    taxonomic assigments and species attributes to define
    inclusive/exclusive clades for grafting with diversification modeling
    for inferring divergence times of imputed branches.
